# Admin token from POST /api/users/auth/login
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### List categories (public)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/categories

### Create category (admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Books", "description": "Programming books" }

### Update category (admin)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "All kinds of books" }

### Delete category (admin) - its products stay, without a category
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Products of a category, sorted by price, page 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?categoryId=1&sortBy=price&order=ASC&page=1&limit=10
